  "text": "Library.Solution PAC - Search JavaScript must be enabled on your browser for this PAC to work properly. LST Library Keyword Search Browse Advanced New Items To search the catalog, select the appropriate search category, click the empty search box, type your search word(s) and click or select \"Search.\" Find: Keywords Titles Authors Subjects Notes Publisher Series ISBN that begin with contain closely match stem from sound like the word(s) To browse the catalog, select the category to be searched, type your browse word(s) or numbers  and click or select \"Search.\" Browse: Titles Authors Subjects Notes Publisher Series Local Call Dewey GPO ISSN LC Call LCCN LCCN 2000+ for To perform an advanced search, type your search word(s) next to the appropriate search type, and click or select \"Search.\" You can search one or more categories simultaneously. Find : as a Title Author Subject Note (Term 1) AND (+) OR  (|) NOT (-) as a Title Author Subject Note (Term 2) AND (+) OR  (|) NOT (-) as a Title Author Subject Note (Term 3) Group terms like : ( Term 1 * Term 2 ) * Term 3 e.g. ;(Red AND White) NOT Blue Term 1 * ( Term 2 * Term 3 ) e.g. Red OR (White AND Blue) Return 10 20 30 40 50 60 100 per page. Available Items Only Received Since All This Month Last Month September 2026 August 2026 May 2026 November 2025 Reading Programs",
